<title>USA: NYMEX COB electric options hit daily volume record.</title>
<headline>NYMEX COB electric options hit daily volume record.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Mercantile Exchange (NYMEX) said its California-Oregon Border electricity (COB) options contract set a daily volume record of 620 contracts during Wednesday's trading session.</p>
<p>The figure surpassed the previous record of 333 contracts set on August 6.</p>
<p>The exchange launched electricity futures and options this past spring.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +1 212 859 1622))</p>
